// Ladybird (Todd Damerson, 1948)

Tempo 152
Keysig C

Groove Metronome2-4
  z * 2
  
Set Lcount 0

/// Lets change the voicing for the Chord (Organ), Chord-Sus (strings),
/// Chord-sax and Chord-Guitar from Optimal to something more open.
Groove Swing
AllGrooves Chord Invert 0
AllGrooves Chord Voicing Mode=Drop23Key
AllGrooves Chord-Sus Voicing Mode=Drop23Key
AllGrooves Chord-Sax Voicing Mode=Drop23Key
AllGrooves Chord-Guitar Voicing Mode=Drop23Key

Repeat 
Inc Lcount  // This starts groove selection to 1

Groove $Lcount Swing  Swing1
Swell mp f 16
1       CM7
2         /
3       Fm7
4       Bb7

Groove $Lcount SwingPlus Swing1Plus

5       CM7
6         /
7      Bbm7
8       Eb7

Groove $Lcount SwingSus Swing1Sus

9      AbM7
10        /
11      Am7
12       D7

Groove $Lcount SwingPlusSus Swing1PlusSus

13      Dm7
14       G7

RepeatEnding 3
15      CM7      /    Eb7
16     AbM7      /    Db7
RepeatEnd

Groove Swing1End
Decresc ppp 2

15      CM7    /     Eb7
16      CM7      z!


